(921, 915, 168, 2, 3, 1377163, 'gbiii12', 'Groupe de Bombardement III/12', '3.Groupe', 'Default Brigade Motto', 'grumet1: Airmen, \nFocus your efforts on supporting priority 1 objectives by providing close air support. Please don\'t waste any DB-7\'s. Also, I ask that each pilot do one RDP mission per log-in. RDP is the air P1. The success or failure of the war effort is in your hands. What shall the history books say?\n\nGeneral de Brigade Grumet1\nCommanding Officer\nGroup de Bombardment III/12\nFrench Air Force', NULL, '2017-11-25 15:32:13', 208, 556, 0, NULL, 1511623933, '1969-12-31 19:00:00', 'frbomint', 2, 'SYSTEM'),
